{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2f4h1RcFC2WYUra5AXqg8A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:24.140575+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2f4h1RcFC2WYUra5AXqg8A","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海理工大学</span></span></p><p><span><span>智能科技学院</span></span></p><p><span><em><span>2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营招生通知</span></em></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院概况</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>上海理工大学智能科技学院以光学人工智能为特色，开展智能科学研究和人才培养，致力于发展成为世界一流的光学人工智能科研机构和拔尖创新人才培养的摇篮。学院积极打造人工智能国家战略科技力量，研发先进的光学人工智能技术，实现更智能、更快捷、更绿色的未来；培养具有科学素养、专业技能、创新能力和国际视野的复合型拔尖人才。</span></span></span></p><p><span>学院汇聚了一批具有国际影响力的学术带头人和优秀中青年学者。现有教学科人员38名，院士2人（其中1名为荣誉教授），国家级人才4人，省部级人才44人次。学院获批上海市类脑光子芯片前沿科学研究基地等省部级科研平台，具有世界一流的光学、材料、生物实验室，承担了国家重点研发计划、上海市市级重大专项等各类重大科研项目，在智能光子器件、全光机器学习、纳米光刻、神经生物成像、多维光场调控、能源光子学等领域开展前沿交叉研究，相关高水平研究成果发表在Nature、Science、Nature Photonics、Nature Nanotechnology 等国际顶级期刊。</span></p><p><span><span>学院内设光学人工智能系和智能材料系，借鉴国外先进办学模式，大胆探索新型机制，以“前沿研究”带动拔尖创新人才自主培养，依托人工智能、材料科学与工程专业以格致创新班的形式开展本科拔尖人才培养，依托光学工程博士点、电子信息专业硕士点开展博士、硕士研究生创新人才培养，积极与物理、生物医学工程、材料学科与工程学位点开展跨学科人才培养，打造具有光学人工智能特色的智能科学本、硕、博人才培养体系。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>基本信息</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>开营时间：</span></strong></span><span>2025年7月8日（如有变动，以学院官网通知为准）</span></p><p><strong><span><span>活动方式：</span></span></strong><span>线下</span></p><p><strong><span><span>招生规模：</span></span></strong><span>约30人</span></p><p><strong><span><span>招生专业：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>（学硕）光学工程</span></p><p><span>（专硕）电子信息 </span></p><p><span>（直博生）光学工程、新能源材料、光电子物理与器件、生物医学工程</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请资格</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（1）热爱祖国，品德良好，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p><p><span>（2）光学工程或电子信息等相近专业背景，或对相应学科有浓厚兴趣的三年级在校本科生（2026届本科毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>（3）学习成绩优秀，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请流程</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>    </span></p><p><span>请有意报名参加夏令营的同学于</span><strong><span><span>2025年6月29日（周一）15:00前</span></span></strong><span>将《2025年上海理工大学智能科技学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》、《2025年上海理工大学智能科技学院夏令营汇总表》以及本科成绩单、相关证明材料发送至邮箱：</span><strong><span><span>saistyjs@163.com</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>单个文件/压缩包命名方式为“姓名+报名专业+材料名称”，邮件主题请按“2025年智能科技学院夏令营报名+姓名+报名专业+联系方式”格式命名。</span></p><p><span>报名材料包含：</span></p><p><span>（1）2025年上海理工大学智能科技学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表；</span></p><p><span>（2）2025年上海理工大学智能科技学院全国优秀大学生夏令营汇总表；</span></p><p><span>（3）身份证正反面扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（4）在校成绩单扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（5）外语等级证书扫描件（如CET4、CET6成绩单）；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他证明材料（各类获奖证书、荣誉证书、已发表论文等扫描件）。</span></p><p><span>（注：夏令营申请表&amp;汇总表详见通知附件）</span></p><p><span>请申请人务必保证提交信息和材料真实准确，如有不实一经发现将直接取消参营资格。</span></p><p><span>学院将审核申请材料并遴选营员。遴选结果将于</span><strong><span><span>2025年7月2日左右</span></span></strong><span>在学院网站进行公示。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>活动安排</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>09:30-09:40  开营仪式</span></p><p><span>09:40-11:40  学院介绍及科研活动</span></p><p><span>13:30-15:30  经验分享与交流</span></p><p><span>15:30-16:00  结营仪式</span></p><p><span>*具体安排以夏令营举办当天为准</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>其他</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（1）针对上海市以外参加夏令营的学生，学院可承担往返交通费用（实报实销，单程不超过500元）。</span></p><section><span>（2）结营后一周内，学院将公布优秀营员名单。</span></section><p><span>（3）具体安排以上海理工大学智能科技学院官方网站通知为准：https://saist.usst.edu.cn/。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><s